# Byte-identical checkouts on every platform: no line-ending
# conversion, ever. The vendored golden/ fixtures are sha-compared
# against the pinned release's copies (fetch.sh / fetch.ps1) — a CRLF
# rewrite on a Windows checkout (the runner images default to
# core.autocrlf=true) would corrupt that byte comparison. This is the
# corvid-go ruling, copied verbatim in spirit.
* -text
